<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Regenerative Tissue</ansi> mutation

Your flesh knits itself back together with unnatural speed. Wounds
close before your eyes, though the constant rebuilding drains your
reserves.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Greatly faster passive health regeneration — your body repairs
  serious wounds at a remarkable rate

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Slightly slower stamina recovery — the constant tissue rebuilding
  consumes energy that could restore endurance

